OL,3,GNEWSAHospital deemed 'dangerous' and
OL,4,A'dreadful' online claims to be among
OL,5,Asafest in the country
OL,6,
OL,7,FSenior staff at Wales' newest hospital
OL,8,Finsist it's safe - despite claims that
OL,9,Fit is dangerous and failing.
OL,11,FSince it opened early in the pandemic,
OL,12,FGrange University Hospital in Cwmbran,
OL,13,FTorfaen, has been under fire over
OL,14,Fconcerns about long delays,
OL,15,Fovercrowding, staff shortages and the
OL,16,Fquality of its care.
OL,18,FCriticism has been especially intense
OL,19,Fon social media, with some in the
OL,20,Fcomments even urging people to stay
OL,21,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
