OL,3,GNEWSAHospital deemed 'dangerous' and
OL,4,A'dreadful' online claims to be among
OL,5,Asafest in the country
OL,6,
OL,7,FBosses admit staff feel "devastated"
OL,8,Fthat patient confidence could be dented
OL,9,Fbut insist the hospital performs better
OL,10,Fthan many others on patient safety,
OL,11,Fincluding survival rates.
